              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iimuchu nea gafuuf Ahitofeli, ghwahidu Yehoyada was orjeeda Benaya, ea Abiyatari; nea shirikarajeanda haw bea sugoocheanda ea Yoabu.",
          "type": "text",
